    // Air authority is one Ticket Group (booking_services) with itinerary and ticket detail children; Passenger Count and Ticket Status are ticket authorities and PNR is service authority. childRows('booking_itinerary_segments' and childRows('air_ticket_details' are retained beneath orderedChildRows().
